2. Compute monthly volume anomaly ratios: Using the CSV, for each (region × product_line) compute the 24-month rolling mean of monthly sales volume, then compute the ratio = current_month_volume / 24-month_mean for every month. Save the full result table to a CSV file (e.g. offline_data/volume_anomaly_ratios.csv) with columns: region, product_line, month, monthly_volume, mean_24m, ratio → code_agent
